title: "Refresh aged Unicorn 79, Stryker 10.1.1 and knip 6.43.0 without changing strict lint policy"
description: "Routine tooling refresh for versions that have passed the seven-day adoption window, measured on 2026-11-01: eslint-plugin-unicorn 79.0.0 (published 2026-10-23), @stryker-mutator/core and vitest-runner 10.1.1 (2026-10-23) and knip 6.43.0 (2026-10-24). knip 6.44.0, ESLint 10.14, typescript-eslint 8.72.1, marked 18.1.2, greptile 3.8, @types/node 26.6.6 and MCP ext-apps 2.0.4 are still inside the window and stay for Dependabot's next eligible run. Stryker 10.1.1 also accepts Vitest 5, which the paired migration on pm-fokyhh needs."
