resolution: "Adopted eslint-plugin-unicorn 79.0.0, @stryker-mutator/core and vitest-runner 10.1.1 and knip 6.43.0, each at least seven days old (published 2026-10-23, 2026-10-23 and 2026-10-24). knip was locked to 6.43.0 because the caret range resolved to the three-day-old 6.44.0. No lint rule, suppression or mutation policy changed. ESLint 10.14, typescript-eslint 8.72.1, marked 18.1.2, greptile 3.8, @types/node 26.6.6, MCP ext-apps 2.0.4 and knip 6.44 remain inside the cooldown for Dependabot."
